{
  "title": "Days, months and time",
  "note": "Days and months are masculine and not capitalized. Dates use le + number (le 14 juillet), except le premier for the first. Le lundi means \"on Mondays\"; lundi alone means one particular Monday. Time uses il est ... heure(s): et quart (:15), et demie (:30), moins le quart (:45).",
  "src": { "t": "Français interactif, Chapitre 1 vocabulaire (la date)", "u": "https://laits.utexas.edu/fi/voc/01/" },
  "items": [
